### Hugo ###
# Build output. .github/workflows/actions.yml rebuilds it from scratch on every
# push to main (`hugo --minify`) before `netlify deploy --dir=public`, so nothing
# reads the committed copy.
#
# It WAS tracked until 2026-08-18, and that was the bug: the workflow's
# "Commit generated PDFs" step runs `git commit -a`, which swept in whichever
# public/ files happened to differ that run. The directory therefore drifted
# piecemeal out of sync with assets/ (public/js/darkmode.js still carried a
# prefers-color-scheme listener the source had dropped). Untracked, `git commit -a`
# skips it entirely.
/public/
.hugo_build.lock
